Add --json to DrawThingsCLI models import

The dry-run and import paths both already hold the finished Specification. The
flag prints it with the encoder settings appendCustomSpecification uses plus
sortedKeys, so models import --dry-run --json emits the exact custom JSON block
an import would append, without importing anything. The summary table is
suppressed and the dependency-download warning moves to stderr, so stdout is
pure JSON either way.
